From your extensions
  history       status commit commits show discard undo ops constraints ack
                dark status    dark commit "what changed"    dark commits    dark undo <name>
  tests         test
                dark test add Me.Hi.greets 'Me.Hi.greet("Ada") |> Stdlib.Test.equal("hi Ada")'
                dark test run Me
  tracing       traces ps
